# Pipe tooltips. tip.shift.* lines are shown while Shift is held.
# Fluid pipes automatically append a cyan "N mB/t" line; power pipes append a red "N RF/t" line.
tip.PipeItemsGravityFeed=Pulls items from the inventory above and sends them down.
tip.shift.PipeItemsGravityFeed=No power required.\nExtraction rate is configurable.
tip.PipeItemsDistributor=Splits items between outputs using configurable ratios.
tip.shift.PipeItemsDistributor=Right-click to set per-side ratios.\nOnly connected sides are used; sides with weight 0 are skipped.
tip.PipeItemsClosed=Stores items that would otherwise be dropped.
tip.shift.PipeItemsClosed=Acts as a normal pipe; undeliverable items go into a 9-slot buffer.\nBreaking the pipe drops the buffer.\nEmits the "Pipe Closed" gate trigger while buffering.
tip.PipeItemsTeleport=Teleports items to other item teleport pipes on the same frequency.
tip.shift.PipeItemsTeleport=Right-click to set frequency and Send/Receive mode.\nPrivate by default; the owner can make it public.\nGates on the pipe transmit redstone wire signals.
tip.PipeLiquidsTeleport=Teleports fluids to other fluid teleport pipes on the same frequency.
tip.shift.PipeLiquidsTeleport=Right-click to set frequency and Send/Receive mode.\nUses the same frequency/state GUI as item teleport pipes.\nGates on the pipe transmit redstone wire signals.
tip.PipePowerTeleport=Teleports RF to other power teleport pipes on the same frequency.
tip.shift.PipePowerTeleport=Only a configurable percentage of the power is transmitted.\nRight-click to set frequency and Send/Receive mode.\nGates on the pipe transmit redstone wire signals.
tip.PipeLogisticsTeleport=Links two Logistics Pipes networks over any distance.
tip.shift.PipeLogisticsTeleport=Requires exactly one other logistics teleport pipe on the same frequency.\nWrench to switch which side the LP pipeline connects to.
tip.PipeSwitchItems=Passes items only while unpowered.
tip.shift.PipeSwitchItems=Disconnects from all sides when powered.\nA cheap redstone-controlled valve; no gate required.
tip.PipeSwitchFluids=Passes fluids only while unpowered.
tip.shift.PipeSwitchFluids=Disconnects from all sides when powered.\nGold-tier fluid throughput.
tip.PipeSwitchPower=Passes RF only while unpowered.
tip.shift.PipeSwitchPower=Disconnects from all sides when powered.\nBetween iron and gold power throughput.
tip.PipeLiquidsWaterPump=Generates water from a source block directly below.
tip.shift.PipeLiquidsWaterPump=Passive; no power required.\nProduction rate is configurable.
tip.PipeItemsAddition=Inserts items only into inventories that already contain them.
tip.shift.PipeItemsAddition=Won't insert into empty or unrelated inventories.\nUseful for topping up specific chests or machines.

